sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(227,242,253) Public Zone
    participant B as Cockpit incidents
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Host
    participant R as REST and IncidentService
    participant S as Scheduler and adapter executor
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant DB as pre_incident, pre_timer
  end
  box rgb(243,229,245) Core and External
    participant X as Agent or remote service
  end
  B->>R: POST /incidents/N3:retry, If-Match "1", Idempotency-Key
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over R,DB: TX0, sync: mark the job due, keep the incident open
    R->>DB: UPDATE pre_timer SET status DUE, next_fire_at now(), attempt reset
    R->>DB: UPDATE pre_incident lock_version 2, COMMIT
  end
  R-->>B: 200, incident OPEN, retryScheduled true
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over S,DB: TX1, claim with lease
    S->>DB: SKIP LOCKED claim, COMMIT
  end
  rect rgb(243,229,245)
    Note over S,X: No transaction while the call runs
    S->>X: call with attemptId
    X-->>S: result or failure
  end
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over S,DB: TX2
    alt success
      S->>DB: advance token, resolve incident, COMMIT
    else failure again
      S->>DB: incident retry_count + 1, stays OPEN, COMMIT
    end
  end
  B->>R: next refresh of the incident list, ETag changed
  R-->>B: incident RESOLVED, or OPEN with a higher retry count
